.TH AVR\-BUILDER\-STOP 1 "" "avr" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-builder-stop \- Stop a builder session, reclaiming its VM and quota slot.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr builder stop
[OPTIONS] SESSION_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stop a builder session, reclaiming its VM and quota slot.
.PP
Asynchronous while the VM is live: the session shows STOPPING until the node confirms teardown. Stopping is idempotent — repeating it on an already-stopped session succeeds.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fISESSION_ID\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR, \fB\-o\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR, \fB\-y\fR
Skip the confirmation prompt.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the raw API response as JSON.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-builder (1),
.BR avr-builder-list (1)
